I like this course, very little proof that is not rigourous.
It also help you to solve some real world problems such as prey-predator system - given some parameters, whether the prey and the predator will go extinction in long run.
Around 1/3 of contents are DSE M2 stuff, you may need to study basic matrix if you have zero experience on it.

May seem easy at first but gets progressively harder, but that's just average math course content; what can I say.

